stateDiagram-v2
    %% Current state axis: Base consumes OP state under an independent OP commit before the Zenith credential commit.
    %% Enrollment audit shape is not implemented; sources and guards are in the transition inventory.
    state "available: unconsumed, before deadline" as available
    state "consumed_at present" as consumed
    state "expired (derived; no stored status)" as expired
    state "unverified enrollment candidate (last_otp_at null)" as unverified
    [*] --> unverified
    [*] --> available
    available --> consumed: store.consume!
    available --> consumed: store.delete
    expired --> consumed: store.delete
    consumed --> consumed: store.delete
    available --> expired: clock reaches deadline
    unverified --> available: accepted code, current usable device
    available --> consumed: Base enrollment final commit
    unverified --> expired: clock reaches deadline
    consumed --> [*]
    expired --> [*]
